      "text": "he will teach us of his ways, Isa. 2:3 (Micah 4:2; 2 Ne. 12:3). I will also give thee for a light to the Gentiles, Isa. 49:6. beautiful upon the mountains are the feet of him … that publisheth salvation, Isa. 52:7 (Mosiah 12:21; 3 Ne. 20:40). Lord hath anointed me to preach good tidings, Isa. 61:1. one of a city, and two of a family, and I will bring you to Zion, Jer. 3:14. I will send for many fishers, Jer. 16:16. I, will both search my sheep, and seek them out, Ezek. 34:11. go to Nineveh … and cry against it, Jonah 1:2. preach … the preaching that I bid thee, Jonah 3:2.",
